  "summary": "Cookie exfiltration to hardcoded webhook.site endpoint on module load",
  "details": "The package's main entry (exploit.js) constructs a DOM form on load, sets an input named 'cookie' to document.cookie, points the form action at a hardcoded https://webhook.site/ URL, and submits the form. Loading the module in a browser context transmits the caller's session cookies to a third-party inspection endpoint the caller did not configure. The file is named exploit.js and contains no other functionality; there is no declared purpose that would justify the behavior.",
